==Latvian==

===Etymology===
From the same stem as the general negative particle {{term|nē||no|lang=lv}}.

===Prefix===
{{lv-prefix}}

# Used on all verb forms to form the negative version of that form ({{term|runāju||I speak|lang=lv}}, {{term|nerunāju||I don't speak|lang=lv}}), as well as on nouns and adjectives to indicate negation (like {{etyl|la|-}} {{term|in-|lang=en}}, {{term|im-|lang=en}}; {{etyl|en|-}} {{term|un-|lang=en}}; or {{etyl|ru|-}} {{term|не-|lang=ru}}).

====Derived terms====
{{prefixsee|lv}}

